{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版解释清楚了身体先于认知松弛、强撑和追求确定的应对方式暂时退场后愿望才得以浮现，以及越珍惜越意识到它可能消逝、因而歌唱更迫切却仍无法获得答案的因果链，也说明了从抓取转向观看如何改变当下的感受；不足是部分心理背景，尤其是已经经历过快乐真实发生并知道它会过去的经历，超出了听感记录直接支持的范围。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版通过此前强撑失效、抵抗暂歇、柔软得以显露、想念逐渐完整并转化为重新连接的愿望这一链条，清楚解释了安宁为何出现以及歌唱为何逐渐充实迫切；但它对168–180小节的进一步转折、迫切感为何仍无法化为完成的表达，以及从抓取转向观看如何改变感受，交代得较为概括或基本未展开。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲版更完整地把身体松弛、心理防御减弱、愿望浮现、失去的可能重新带来急迫感以及最终无法获得确定答案串成了连续的局部因果机制，虽然有少量超出记录的心理背景，但并未削弱其对关键转折的解释力，整体不逊于乙版。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "549debe2-0dc3-4dcb-9df8-dc9f0634a413", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134004299724Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:40:58.385845+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "afece23ed8cf71561c91e63090498289e40cb24c1f5fa63c2c5b0586d9bac318", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0